<%
  contract_number = @contract.respond_to?(:invoice_number) ? @contract.invoice_number : "##{@contract.id}"
  customer_name = (@contract.respond_to?(:recipient_company) && @contract.recipient_company&.name) || "Customer"
  billing_date = @on_date&.strftime("%b %d, %Y") || Date.current.strftime("%b %d, %Y")
  destination_url = begin subscription_url(@contract) rescue invoices_url end
%>
RECURRING INVOICE GENERATION FAILED

An automated background billing cycle could not be completed for your recurring subscription.

Error Details:
<%= @error_message %>

Contract Number: <%= contract_number %>
Customer: <%= customer_name %>
Attempted Billing Date: <%= billing_date %>

Review the subscription and retry recurring invoice generation:
<%= destination_url %>
